<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<TimeML xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="TimeML_1.2.1.xsd">
  <DOCID>begona</DOCID>
  <TIMEX3 tid="t0" type="DATE" value="2014-04-11T00:00:00" functionInDocument="CREATION_TIME" temporalFunction="false">2014-04-11</TIMEX3>
  <TEXT>25 urteko pazientea, kanpoko zentro batean <EVENT eid="e1" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">diagnostikatutako</EVENT> ezkerreko bularreko <EVENT eid="e2" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kartzinoma</EVENT> bategatik <EVENT eid="e3" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kontsulta</EVENT> egiten duena.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e4" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">AURREKARIAK</EVENT>&#13;
<EVENT eid="e5" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Familia-aurrekariak</EVENT>:&#13;
-Amak alde bietako bularreko <EVENT eid="e6" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kartzinoma</EVENT> (33 urterekin <EVENT eid="e7" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">diagnostikatuta</EVENT>).&#13;
-2 izebak eta aitaldeko amonak bularreko <EVENT eid="e8" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kartzinoma</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e9" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Aurrekari</EVENT> mediko-kirurgikoak: <TIMEX3 tid="t1" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">oraingo</TIMEX3> episodiorako <EVENT eid="e10" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">interesik</EVENT> gabe.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e11" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Aurrekari</EVENT> ginekologiko obstetrikoak:&#13;
<EVENT eid="e12" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Nuligesta</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e13" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">M</EVENT>: 11 <EVENT eid="e14" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">TM</EVENT>: erregularra <EVENT eid="e15" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">AM</EVENT>: ASH&#13;
<TIMEX3 tid="t2" type="DATE" value="PRESENT_REF" temporalFunction="true">GAUR EGUNEKO</TIMEX3> <EVENT eid="e16" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">GAIXOTASUNA</EVENT>&#13;
<EVENT eid="e17" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Noduluaren</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e18" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">autopalpazioa</EVENT> ezkerreko bularrean. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e19" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Jariorik</EVENT> ez titiburutik. &#13;
Bestelako <EVENT eid="e20" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">klinikarik</EVENT> gabe.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e21" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">MIAKETA</EVENT>&#13;
-4X3cm-ko <EVENT eid="e22" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">nodulua</EVENT> ezkerreko bularreko kanpoko beheko koadrantean(CIE). &#13;
Eskuineko bularra, <EVENT eid="e23" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">normal</EVENT>. Besapeak (-).&#13;
<EVENT eid="e24" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">IRUDI-PROBAK</EVENT>&#13;
Bularretako <EVENT eid="e25" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ekografia</EVENT>, <EVENT eid="e26" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">mamografia</EVENT>:&#13;
-Ezkerreko bularra: <EVENT eid="e27" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Masa</EVENT> kanpoko beheko koadrantean(CIE), <EVENT eid="e28" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">inguru</EVENT> irregularrak eta <EVENT eid="e29" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">egitura</EVENT> heterogeneoa dituena, <EVENT eid="e30" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">hedadura</EVENT> duktalarekin areola atzeko zonarantz; gehieneko <EVENT eid="e31" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">diametroa</EVENT> 6 cm-koa da.&#13;
-Eskuineko bularra: <EVENT eid="e32" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">mikrokaltzifikazio-metaketa</EVENT> barneko goiko koadrantean(CSI).&#13;
-Ezkerreko besapea: itxura patologikoko <EVENT eid="e33" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">adenopatia</EVENT>.&#13;
-Eskuineko besapea:<EVENT eid="e34" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">aurkikuntza</EVENT> patologikorik ez.&#13;
EMN&#13;
Eskuineko bularra (kaptazio patologikoko zenbait <EVENT eid="e35" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">foku</EVENT>):&#13;
-Barneko goiko koadrantean(CSI): 1,6cm-ko <EVENT eid="e36" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">lesioa</EVENT>&#13;
-Koadrante arteko sakoneko zonan(IC): 4mm-ko <EVENT eid="e37" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">nodulu</EVENT> txikia, toraxeko paretatik 10mm-ra.&#13;
-Koadrante arteko kanpoko zonan (ICE): 1,7cm-ko <EVENT eid="e38" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">nodulua</EVENT>, toraxeko paretatik 4mm-ra.&#13;
-Kanpoko beheko sakoneko koadrantean (CIE):inguru irregularretako <EVENT eid="e39" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">nodulua</EVENT>, 1,9cm-koa, pareta ondoan.&#13;
Ezkerreko bularra-8-10cm-ko <EVENT eid="e40" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">MASA</EVENT> handia, kanpoko beheko koadrantea <EVENT eid="e41" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">betetzen</EVENT> duena.&#13;
-Barneko beheko koadrantean (CII): 5mm-ko <EVENT eid="e42" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">nodulua</EVENT>.&#13;
Ezkerreko besape-eremua:&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e43" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Adenopatia</EVENT> patologikoak.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e44" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">ANATOMIA</EVENT> PATOLOGIKOA&#13;
-Orratz lodiko <EVENT eid="e45" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">biopsia</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e46" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BAG</EVENT>) ezkerreko bularrean: <EVENT eid="e47" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Kartzinoma</EVENT> duktal infiltratzailea, II. maila histologikoa. &#13;
<EVENT eid="e48" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Inbasio</EVENT> baskular linfatikoa.&#13;
-Hutsaren bidez lagundutako <EVENT eid="e49" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">biopsia</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e50" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BAV</EVENT>), eskuineko bularreko <EVENT eid="e51" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">estereotaxiagatik</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e52" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kartzinoma</EVENT> duktal infiltratzailea, maila nuklear altuko <EVENT eid="e53" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">kartzinoma</EVENT> intraduktalarekin, <EVENT eid="e54" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">komedonekrosia</EVENT> lotuta duela.&#13;
-Orratz lodiko <EVENT eid="e55" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">biopsia</EVENT> (<EVENT eid="e56" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">BAG</EVENT>) ezkerreko besapean: kartzinoma duktalaren <EVENT eid="e57" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">metastasia</EVENT>.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e58" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">IMMUNOHISTOKIMIKA</EVENT>&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e59" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Estrogeno-hartzaileak</EVENT>: negatiboa&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e60" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Progesterona-hartzaileak</EVENT>: negatiboa&#13;
Negatibo hirukoitza&#13;
-Her2 genearen <EVENT eid="e61" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">anplifikaziorik</EVENT> ez.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e62" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Ki67</EVENT>: Positibitatea (% 40)&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e63" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">p53</EVENT>: positiboa maila handian (% 90)&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e64" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Ck</EVENT> 19: positibitate moderatua (% 80)&#13;
<EVENT eid="e65" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">HEDADURA-AZTERKETA</EVENT>&#13;
-Torax, abdomen eta pelbiseko <EVENT eid="e66" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">OTA</EVENT>: distantziako <EVENT eid="e67" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">barreiadura-zeinurik</EVENT> gabe.&#13;
-<EVENT eid="e68" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Hezur-gammagrafia</EVENT>: <EVENT eid="e69" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">metastasiaren</EVENT> <EVENT eid="e70" class="REPORTING" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">iradokitze-zeinurik</EVENT> gabe.&#13;
<EVENT eid="e71" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">TRATAMENDUA</EVENT>&#13;
1.-<EVENT eid="e72" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Obozito-kontserbazioa</EVENT>&#13;
2.-<EVENT eid="e73" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Kimioterapia</EVENT> neoadjubantea&#13;
3.-<EVENT eid="e74" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Kirurgia</EVENT> (Bularreko Patologiako eta Kirurgia Plastikoko Unitatea)&#13;
4.-<EVENT eid="e75" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Psikoonkologia</EVENT>&#13;
5.-<EVENT eid="e76" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Errehabilitazioa</EVENT>&#13;
6.-<EVENT eid="e77" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Erradioterapia</EVENT>&#13;
7.-<EVENT eid="e78" class="OCCURRENCE" comment="e3c:permanence=FINITE">Azterketa</EVENT> genetikoa&#13;
</TEXT>
